py:main` at its complexity baseline by extracting the helper.\n\n### Verification\n- Full G3 gate: the new **module-coverage step passes** against the real floors (agent_session 81.04≥72, subagent_gate 39.66≥34, plan_runner 79.59≥75); global coverage 91.97%.\n- Full unfiltered suite: **1393 passed**, only failure is the **pre-existing WI-275 `status.md` forward-only red** — confirmed on the base tree, it's root-coordination truth (`docs/status.md`, WI-275's Status/spec) the worker contract forbids me from touching; the integrator reconciles it.\n- ruff format + lint clean under the 3.11.9 venv.\n\n### Scope note\nI initially updated the SR-110/LLR-098/TC-101 registry text to describe the strengthened behavior, but that staled `PROJECT_STATE.html` (a cross-WI aggregate dashboard the worker contract reserves for the integrator). Since the findings are fully satisfied by the code + tests (TC-101's evidence is the test file, now covering NaN/Infinity), I reverted the spine-text edits, keeping the change set to 6 files and leaving all generated artifacts fresh."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2070,"cache_read_input_tokens":223477,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2070},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66413f4b-e093-47b5-92ce-979e3a291f6c","uuid":"d8f4f9bc-aa97-44d1-b1a7-1cb301c0dadd","request_id":"req_011CdKnC26moS9aWcZ52P12f"}
